    <section class="references" id="sect-00018">
    <title>References</title>
    <para id="para-00047">Aspen Institute, Project Play. (2023). <emphasis effect="italics">State of Play 2022: Trends in Youth Sports</emphasis>. Retrieved from https://projectplay.org/state-of-play-2023/participation</para>
